    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "bashir",
      "text": "Mist on every peak, and bamboo thicker than any forest in the west. The road ends here, General."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "titus",
      "text": "Roads end. Soldiers keep walking. My legs have not heard the news yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Do you know where we stand? This is the land where blasting powder was born."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Every trick I learned in Persia, some monk here learned a thousand years before me. I want to see how they do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "spawn",
      "actor": "villager",
      "character": "messenger",
      "x": 9,
      "facing": -1,
      "pose": "walk"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 3,
      "y": -1.6,
      "viewHeight": 7,
      "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "move",
      "actor": "villager",
      "x": 4,
      "duration": 2.2
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "villager",
      "pose": "kneel"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "villager",
      "text": "Strangers, turn back. You march into Warlord Tao's country."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "villager",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "villager",
      "text": "His soldiers carry fire-lances that spit flame, and rockets that scream down from the sky."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "villager",
      "text": "He burned my village for sheltering one of his runaway scouts. The mountains belong to him now."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "villager",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Fire-lances and rockets. So Tao has learned my craft, and learned it well."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Then we will meet fire with fire. Tao serves the Iron Crown, and the Iron Hand has fled to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "We cross these mountains, and we do not turn back."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "villager",
      "text": "Then may the mountains be kinder to you than they were to us."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "villager",
      "pose": "walk",
      "facing": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "move",
      "actor": "villager",
      "x": 10,
      "duration": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "remove",
      "actor": "villager"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "point"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "First the watchpost in the bamboo. Break it, and Tao's passes lie open."
    },
